  "title": "Sausage and Rice Stuffed Peppers",
  "description": "Stuffed green peppers with rice and sausage in cheesy tomato sauce. Tomato soup is used instead of tomato sauce. Very, very good.",
  "authors": [
    "NANCIENANCIE"
  ],
